    <p class="lede">A recirculation pump gives you hot water at the tap in 1–2 seconds instead of 30–60. That&rsquo;s the headline benefit. Energy and water savings are real but often overstated — and one common configuration actually <em>increases</em> your energy bill. This guide walks through the five mainstream approaches and tells you which makes sense for your situation.</p>
