      <a href="#the-energy-trap">4. The energy trap</a>
      <a href="#pair-with-tankless-or-hpwh">5. Pair with tankless or HPWH?</a>
      <a href="#related-guides" class="border-brand-300 bg-brand-50 text-brand-700 hover:bg-brand-100 hover:text-brand-700">Related &amp; calculator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
